<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">My eyes once dull with boredom</text><text for="L2">My face once blank and empty</text><text for="L3">Now glow when I look at you</text><text for="L4">When I see you, my eyes turn odd</text><text for="L5">Inside me, it blooms so densely all in blue</text><text for="L6">Every emotion I feel now is true</text><text for="L7">The strange name tingling on my lips</text><text for="L8">I never knew my heart was so full of colors</text><text for="L9">You make me dream so long, this room feels like a little heaven</text><text for="L10">I dance as much as I want, until I'm dizzy</text><text for="L11">Oh my, oh my god</text><text for="L12">Another piece falls into place</text><text for="L13">Watch this, one, two, three, four, five, six, seven</text><text for="L14">You make me feel like eleven</text><text for="L15">So transparent, the space between us</text><text for="L16">As I look deeper into it</text><text for="L17">Into the ripping waves</text><text for="L18">I'm pulled further in</text><text for="L19">That day, a fragrant violet mood</text><text for="L20">A dream on repeat, still as sweet as ever, feels so good</text><text for="L21">Who could ever make my heart race like this?</text><text for="L22">I never knew my heart was so full of colors</text><text for="L23">You make me dream so long, this room feels like a little heaven</text><text for="L24">I dance as much as I want, until I'm dizzy</text><text for="L25">Oh my, oh my god</text><text for="L26">Another piece falls into place</text><text for="L27">Watch this, one, two, three, four, five, six, seven</text><text for="L28">You make me feel like eleven</text><text for="L29">You, the one standing before me</text><text for="L30">Me, the one reflected in your eyes (the one reflected in your eyes)</text><text for="L31">Ah-yeah, ah-yeah, ah-yeah (I'm just looking into it)</text><text for="L32">You, the one standing before me</text><text for="L33">Me, the one reflected in your eyes</text><text for="L34">I'm just looking into it</text><text for="L35">Don't say now</text><text for="L36">Don't rush in too fast</text><text for="L37">I like this moment, yeah</text><text for="L38">I never knew my heart was so full of colors</text><text for="L39">You make me dream so long, this room feels like a little heaven</text><text for="L40">I dance as much as I want, until I'm dizzy</text><text for="L41">Oh my, oh my god</text><text for="L42">Another piece falls into place</text><text for="L43">Watch this, one, two, three, four, five, six, seven</text><text for="L44">You make me feel like eleven</text><text for="L45">You, the one standing before me</text><text for="L46">Me, the one reflected in your eyes</text><text for="L47">Ah-yeah, ah-yeah, ah-yeah</text><text for="L48">You, the one standing before me</text><text for="L49">Me, the one reflected in your eye</text><text for="L50">I've fallen in love</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>서지음</songwriter><songwriter>Peter Rycroft</songwriter><songwriter>Lauren Aquilina</songwriter><songwriter>Ryan S. Jhun</songwriter></songwriters><audio lyricOffset="-0.046" role="spatial"/><transliterations><transliteration automaticallyCreated="true" xml:lang="ko-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="9.681" end="11.287" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">tta bun han</span>  <span begin="11.287" end="12.228" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">na ui</span>  <span begin="12.228" end="13.776" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nun bi chi</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="13.786" end="16.255" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mu pyo jeong haet deon</span>  <span begin="16.255" end="17.737